          <p>Now, it is paramount that you complete this reading to the very end. Because after introducing your <span class="archetype">Outlaw</span> archetype, I will show you how you can leverage on this energetic shift to <span class="text-orange">catapult your growth forward.</span> That means no more mulling over opportunities, and no more retreating in the face of adversity.</p>
